; STAGE 4 (OPTIONAL / SPECULATIVE) - ring stretch force constant
;
; F1,1 + F6,6 gives only  f + 2*f_meta = 8.113 aJ/A^2
; With F10,10 = 7.663 this brackets f_ring ~ 7.7-8.1 aJ/A^2,
; but it is NOT uniquely determined without the full E' block
; algebra and the B-matrix.
;
; f_ring = 7.8 aJ/A^2 -> 469700 kJ/mol/nm^2  (vs LigParGen 420073.6)
;
; WARNING: your MD already places the ring C=N peak at ~1712 cm^-1,
; roughly +77 above the highest refined experimental band in that
; region (nu12 = 1635). Stiffening the ring will push it HIGHER.
; Test this stage separately and be prepared to revert.
;
; To apply, replace the six ring kb values 420073.6 with 469700.0
;=====================================================================

